                    </a>
                    <p class="footer-intro">Thoughtful company law, compliance and corporate advisory support from Morbi, Gujarat.</p>
                    <p class="footer-address">326, 3rd Floor, Star Arcade<br />Sanala Road, Morbi - 363641<br />Gujarat, India</p>
                    <a href="tel:+917567096966">Mobile: +91 75670 96966</a>
                    <a href="mailto:cs@sonagra.com">cs@sonagra.com</a>
                </div>
                <div class="col-lg-3"><h3>Our Services</h3><a href="/our-services/corporate-law-and-advisory/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Corporate Law and Advisory</a><a href="/our-services/sebi-matters-and-ipo-services/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">SEBI Matters and IPO Services</a><a href="/our-services/fema-matters/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">FEMA Matters</a><a href="/our-services/amalgamation-merger-de-merger-takeover/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Amalgamation, Merger, De-merger &amp; Takeover</a><a href="/our-services/corporate-governance-services/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Corporate Governance Services</a><a href="/our-services/rbi-and-nbfc-related-compliances/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">RBI and NBFC Related Compliances</a><a href="/our-services/intellectual-property-rights-trademark-tm/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Intellectual Property Rights – Trademark (TM)</a><a href="/our-services/other-services/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Other Services</a></div>
                <div class="col-lg-2"><h3>Useful Links</h3><a href="https://www.mca.gov.in/content/mca/global/en/home.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">MCA</a><a href="https://www.sebi.gov.in/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">SEBI</a><a href="https://ipindia.gov.in/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">IPR</a><a href="https://www.incometax.gov.in/iec/foportal/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Income Tax</a><a href="https://www.gst.gov.in/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GST</a><a href="https://nclt.gov.in/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">NCLT</a><a href="https://ibbi.gov.in//en/legal-framework/act" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">IBBI</a></div>
                <div class="col-lg-3"><h3>Location</h3><div class="footer-map-frame"><iframe title="Sonagra and Company location in Morbi" src="https://www.google.com/maps?q=326%203rd%20Floor%20Star%20Arcade%20Sanala%20Road%20Morbi%20Gujarat%20363641&amp;output=embed" loading="lazy" referrerpolicy="no-referrer-when-downgrade"></iframe></div><a class="map-link" href="https://maps.app.goo.gl/jbeTXLArzdvhij428" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Open primary location in Maps ↗</a><a class="map-link" href="https://maps.app.goo.gl/CXhEhev962HLuWV58" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Open second location in Maps ↗</a></div>
            </div>
            <div class="footer-bottom"><span>&copy; @DateTime.Now.Year Sonagra &amp; Company. All rights reserved.</span><a asp-area="" asp-controller="Home" asp-action="Privacy">Privacy policy</a></div>
        </div>
